# 换行与文本属性（CLAUDE.md 第 13 节：UTF-8、LF）
# 仓库内统一存 LF，检出到工作区也用 LF，避免 IDE / Git 自动转成 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理/PowerShell 脚本必须保留 CRLF，否则可能无法执行。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：禁止换行转换与文本 diff。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.zip binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.docx binary
*.xdb binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
